[{"answer":"Good afternoon, Ms. Pennington.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/1.mp3"},{"answer":"You are in my, um, American History 201 class, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/2.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help you today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's about my term paper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I, uh, I know it's due next Monday, but, um, I was hoping...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think I can get it done by then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I please turn it in by the end of next week instead?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I have a really good excuse.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh I'm sure you do!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been teaching 33 years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know how many excuses I've heard?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/11.mp3"},{"answer":"\"My dog ate my paper\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/12.mp3"},{"answer":"\"My roommate had a party so I couldn't concentrate\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/13.mp3"},{"answer":"\"I have seven papers due in the same day!\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/14.mp3"},{"answer":"\"I went home to see my parents and my car broke down\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/15.mp3"},{"answer":"My favorite was a student who told me she \"forgot\" all about her term paper until the day before it was due.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It's amazing she remembered to come to class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh, I didn't forget, sir.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been working on the paper, really!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Here, I brought my outline and a rough draft.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/20.mp3"},{"answer":"It's, um, just that... well, a lot of things have been going on in my life,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm having trouble managing things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/23.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, I assigned that paper four weeks ago,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and I've been reminding students about it in each class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/25.mp3"},{"answer":"So, tell me your story.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/26.mp3"},{"answer":"What's happening in your life?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/27.mp3"},{"answer":"First, about two weeks ago, my roommate found out her mother is real sick.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/28.mp3"},{"answer":"She has breast cancer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/29.mp3"},{"answer":"So she's been really upset, and, uh,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I went home with her for a couple of days to see her mom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/31.mp3"},{"answer":"That caused me to miss biology lab,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and I have a huge biology final coming up on Tuesday that I really need to study for this weekend.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I got the flu last week, and missed a day of class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I tried to work on your paper that day, but I felt really horrible...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/35.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I can understand that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm glad that you're, er, helping your roommate through a tough time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/37.mp3"},{"answer":"That's more important than school work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/38.mp3"},{"answer":"But all this seems to have happened recently.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/39.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the two weeks after I first assigned the term paper?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I, uh... I guess I didn't use that time very well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I kind of put off getting started on it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/43.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, if I had a dollar for every time I've heard a student say that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry, Professor Dalton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I've learned my lesson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/46.mp3"},{"answer":"If I had spent just a little bit of time each week on the paper, I could have had it done on time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I know now that I need to plan for unexpected things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/48.mp3"},{"answer":"You seem like a bright, conscientious young lady, Ms...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/49.mp3"},{"answer":"your first name's Jill, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/50.mp3"},{"answer":"When I was a young student, an upperclassman gave me some advice that I've never forgotten.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/51.mp3"},{"answer":"He said, \"You're going to find yourself with a lot of small gaps during school days,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/52.mp3"},{"answer":"15 minutes, or half an hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/53.mp3"},{"answer":"What you do during those gaps will make a big difference in how successful you are\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow! That's great advice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I thought so. And I still do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/56.mp3"},{"answer":"So I'll tell you what.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/57.mp3"},{"answer":"You can turn your paper in no later than 9 a.m. on Friday, right here on my office desk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/58.mp3"},{"answer":"In exchange for this favor,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I want you to pass that advice on to all your friends and dorm mates.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you, professor Dalton!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/61.mp3"},{"answer":"You bet I will.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, as long as you're here, let me take a peek at your outline and rough draft.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any questions about the paper that I can help you with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-5-2023-01-18-22-54-38/64.mp3"}]
